#: includes/ServicePoint/Shipping/class-service-point-shipping-method.php:70
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/service-point/sendcloud-setup.php:278
msgid "Carrier Selection"
msgstr "Val av transportör"

#. translators: Instruction heading for configuring product data
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-configure-product.php:23
msgid "Configure product data"
msgstr "Konfigurera produktdata"

#. translators: Description text explaining why to import all necessary item details into Sendcloud
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-configure-product.php:33
msgid ""
"To ensure all necessary item details are imported into Sendcloud, helping "
"you stay compliant with carrier requirements and customs documentation."
msgstr ""
"För att säkerställa att alla nödvändiga artikeluppgifter importeras till Sendcloud, så att du "
"uppfyller transportörernas krav och kraven på tulldokumentation."

#. translators: %1$s and %2$s wrap <strong>EAN</strong> %3$s and %4$s wrap <strong>HS Code</strong> %5$s and %6$s wrap <strong>Country of Origin</strong>
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-configure-product.php:51
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Now that you’ve migrated to V2, new fields for %1$sEAN%2$s, %3$sHS Code%4$s, "
"and %5$sCountry of Origin%6$s are available in WooCommerce. You no longer "
"need to create custom attributes for these details."
msgstr ""
"Nu när du har migrerat till V2 finns det nya fält för %1$sEAN%2$s, %3$sHS-"
"kod%4$s och %5$sUrsprungsland%6$s i WooCommerce. Du behöver inte längre "
"skapa egna attribut för de här uppgifterna."

#. translators: %1$s and %2$s wrap <strong>Note:</strong>
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-configure-product.php:67
#, php-format
msgid "%1$sNote:%2$s"
msgstr "%1$sOBS!%2$s"

#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-configure-product.php:78
msgid ""
"If both the old custom attributes and the new fields are filled in, the new "
"fields take priority."
msgstr ""
"Om både de gamla, egna attributen och de nya "
"fälten är ifyllda har de nya fälten företräde."

#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-configure-product.php:86
msgid ""
"We recommend using the new fields and removing the old custom attributes "
"when possible to ensure accurate product data."
msgstr ""
"Vi rekommenderar att du använder de nya fälten och tar bort de gamla egna "
"attributen när det går, så att produktdata blir korrekt."

#. translators: Section heading for setting EAN (European Article Number) codes
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-configure-product.php:100
msgid "Setting EAN Codes"
msgstr "Ange EAN-koder"

#. translators: %1$s and %2$s wrap 'Products' in italics; %3$s and %4$s wrap 'All Products' in italics; %5$s and %6$s wrap 'Product Data > Inventory' in italics
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-configure-product.php:112
#, php-format
msgid ""
"In your WooCommerce dashboard, go to %1$sProducts%2$s > %3$sAll Products%4$s "
"and select a product. Under %5$sProduct Data > Inventory%6$s, enter the EAN "
"in:"
msgstr ""
"Gå till %1$sProdukter%2$s > %3$sAlla produkter%4$s i WooCommerce och välj en "
"produkt. Under %5$sProduktdata > Lager%6$s anger du EAN i:"

#. translators: %1$s and %2$s wrap 'EAN by Sendcloud' in bold; %3$s and %4$s wrap '9.2.' in bold
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-configure-product.php:129
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%1$sEAN by Sendcloud%2$s field for WooCommerce versions below %3$s9.2%4$s"
msgstr ""
"fältet %1$sEAN by Sendcloud%2$s för WooCommerce-versioner äldre än "
"%3$s9.2%4$s"

#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-configure-product.php:140
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-configure-product.php:159
msgid "Screenshot of EAN Attribute"
msgstr "Skärmbild av EAN-attributet"

#. translators: %1$s and %2$s wrap 'EAN' in bold; %3$s and %4$s wrap '9.2 and higher' in bold
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-configure-product.php:148
#, php-format
msgid ""
"WooCommerce’s native %1$sEAN%2$s field for versions %3$s9.2 and higher%4$s"
msgstr "WooCommerce egna fält för %1$sEAN%2$s i version %3$s9.2 och senare%4$s"

#. translators: Section heading for configuring HS Codes and Country of Origin (used in international shipping)
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-configure-product.php:168
msgid "Setting HS Codes and Country of Origin (for international shipping)"
msgstr "Ange HS-koder och ursprungsland (för internationella leveranser)"

#. translators: %1$s and %2$s wrap the word 'Shipping' (tab name in WooCommerce Product Data) in bold
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-configure-product.php:181
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Enter the HS Code and Country of Origin under the %1$sShipping%2$s tab in "
"Product Data."
msgstr ""
"Ange HS-kod och ursprungsland under fliken %1$sFrakt%2$s i Produktdata."

#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-configure-product.php:192
msgid "Screenshot of HS Code and Country Attribute"
msgstr "Skärmbild av HS-kod och ursprungsland"

#. translators: Section heading for managing synchronisation settings between Sendcloud and WooCommerce
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:22
msgid "Manage synchronisation settings between Sendcloud and WooCommerce"
msgstr "Hantera synkroniseringsinställningar mellan Sendcloud och WooCommerce"

#. translators: Instruction line explaining adjustment of data flow between webshop and Sendcloud
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:32
msgid "To adjust how data flows between your webshop and Sendcloud."
msgstr "Så att du styr hur data flödar mellan din webbutik och Sendcloud."

#. translators: Instruction or label to enable webhook feedback
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:48
msgid "Enable webhook feedback"
msgstr "Aktivera webhook-feedback"

#. translators: Instruction explaining that enabling the feature will send real-time updates from Sendcloud to WooCommerce
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:58
msgid "To send real-time updates from Sendcloud to WooCommerce."
msgstr "Så att Sendcloud skickar uppdateringar till WooCommerce i realtid."

#. translators: Instruction or label to create an API endpoint in WooCommerce/Sendcloud integration
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:71
msgid "Create an API endpoint:"
msgstr "Skapa en API-slutpunkt:"

#. translators: Instruction explaining that an API endpoint is required to receive webhook updates from Sendcloud
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:79
msgid ""
"To receive webhook updates, you need an API endpoint that can handle "
"incoming requests from Sendcloud."
msgstr ""
"För att ta emot webhook-uppdateringar behöver du en API-slutpunkt som kan "
"hantera inkommande anrop från Sendcloud."

#. translators: Instruction or label to configure webhook feedback in Sendcloud
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:90
msgid "Configure webhook feedback in Sendcloud:"
msgstr "Konfigurera webhook-feedback i Sendcloud:"

#. translators: %1$s and %2$s wrap 'Settings' in italics; %3$s and %4$s wrap 'Integrations' as a clickable link; %5$s and %6$s wrap 'Configure' in bold
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:105
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Go to your Sendcloud panel and navigate to %1$sSettings%2$s > "
"%3$sIntegrations%4$s. Then click %5$sConfigure%6$s on your WooCommerce "
"integration."
msgstr ""
"Gå till din Sendcloud-panel och öppna %1$sInställningar%2$s > "
"%3$sIntegrationer%4$s. Klicka sedan på %5$sKonfigurera%6$s vid din "
"WooCommerce-integration."

#. translators: %1$s and %2$s wrap 'Webhook feedback enabled.' in bold
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:125
#, php-format
msgid "Select the checkbox for %1$sWebhook feedback enabled%2$s."
msgstr "Markera kryssrutan %1$sWebhook feedback enabled%2$s."

#. translators: Instruction or label asking the user to enter the webhook URL
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:140
msgid "Enter the webhook URL:"
msgstr "Ange webhook-URL:"

#. translators: %1$s and %2$s wrap 'Webhook URL field' in bold
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:149
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Copy your webhook URL from your application and paste it into the "
"%1$sWebhook URL field%2$s in Sendcloud."
msgstr ""
"Kopiera webhook-URL:en från din applikation och klistra in den i fältet "
"%1$sWebhook URL%2$s i Sendcloud."

#. translators: Instruction to set up a webhook Signature Key if it is available
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:162
msgid "If present, set up a webhook Signature Key:"
msgstr "Om det finns, ange en signeringsnyckel för webhooken:"

#. translators: Explanation that this is a password used to sign all Sendcloud webhook requests
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:170
msgid ""
"This is a password used to sign all Sendcloud webhook requests. The key "
"should:"
msgstr ""
"Det här är ett lösenord som används för att signera alla webhook-anrop från "
"Sendcloud. Nyckeln ska:"

#. translators: %1$s and %2$s wrap '16 characters long' in bold
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:180
#, php-format
msgid "Be at least %1$s16 characters long%2$s"
msgstr "Vara minst %1$s16 tecken lång%2$s"

#. translators: %1$s and %2$s wrap 'one number, one uppercase letter, one lowercase letter' in bold; %3$s and %4$s wrap 'one special character' in bold
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:194
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Contain at least %1$sone number, one uppercase letter, one lowercase "
"letter%2$s, and %3$sone special character%4$s"
msgstr ""
"Innehålla minst %1$sen siffra, en versal, en gemen%2$s och %3$sett "
"specialtecken%4$s"

#. translators: Instruction or label to test your webhook
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:210
msgid "Test your webhook:"
msgstr "Testa din webhook:"

#. translators: %1$s and %2$s wrap 'Test API webhook' button text in bold
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:219
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Click on the %1$sTest API webhook%2$s button to verify your setup. If your "
"webhook is working correctly, you should start receiving payloads at your "
"application."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på knappen %1$sTest API webhook%2$s för att kontrollera din "
"konfiguration. Fungerar webhooken som den ska börjar du ta emot data i din "
"applikation."

#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:229
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:324
msgid "Screenshot of Test Webhook"
msgstr "Skärmbild av webhook-test"

#. translators: Label for instruction to save the configuration
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:237
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Spara"

#. translators: %1$s and %2$s wrap 'Save' button text in bold
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:246
#, php-format
msgid "Click %1$sSave%2$s to finalise the configuration."
msgstr "Klicka på %1$sSpara%2$s för att slutföra konfigurationen."

#. translators: Instruction or label to adjust the order status synchronization settings
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:262
msgid "Adjust order status sync"
msgstr "Justera synkronisering av orderstatus"

#. translators: Instruction explaining how WooCommerce order statuses are updated when changes occur in Sendcloud
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:272
msgid ""
"To choose how WooCommerce order statuses are updated when changes occur in "
"Sendcloud."
msgstr ""
"För att välja hur orderstatus i WooCommerce uppdateras när något ändras i "
"Sendcloud."

#. translators: %1$s and %2$s wrap 'Settings' in italics; %3$s and %4$s wrap 'Integrations' as a clickable link; %5$s and %6$s wrap 'Configure' in bold
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:288
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/service-point/sendcloud-setup.php:56
#, php-format
msgid ""
"In your Sendcloud account, go to %1$sSettings%2$s > %3$sIntegrations%4$s, "
"find your WooCommerce integration and click %5$sConfigure%6$s."
msgstr ""
"Gå till %1$sInställningar%2$s > %3$sIntegrationer%4$s i ditt Sendcloud-"
"konto, hitta din WooCommerce-integration och klicka på %5$sKonfigurera%6$s."

#. translators: %1$s and %2$s wrap 'Feedback to the webshop' in bold; the following list items explain feedback options
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:308
#, php-format
msgid ""
"In the %1$sFeedback to the webshop%2$s dropdown, select whether and how you "
"would like your WooCommerce order statuses to be updated:"
msgstr ""
"Välj i listan %1$sFeedback to the webshop%2$s om, och hur, orderstatus i "
"WooCommerce ska uppdateras:"

#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:316
msgid "Don’t send any feedback"
msgstr "Skicka ingen feedback"

#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:317
msgid "Change the parcels’ status to “sent” once the carrier scans the label"
msgstr ""
"Ändra paketens status till ”skickat” när transportören har skannat etiketten"

#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:319
msgid ""
"Change the parcels’ status to “sent” once the label\n"
"                                         is created"
msgstr "Ändra paketens status till ”skickat” när etiketten har skapats"

#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:326
msgid ""
"The default selection is for the parcels' status to be set to \"sent\" once "
"the label is created"
msgstr ""
"Som standard sätts paketens status till ”skickat” när etiketten har skapats"

#. translators: Section heading for filtering imported orders by their status
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:338
msgid "Filter imported orders by status"
msgstr "Filtrera importerade ordrar efter status"

#. translators: Short description explaining that this controls which orders are imported into Sendcloud
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:345
msgid "To control which orders are imported into Sendcloud."
msgstr "Så att du styr vilka ordrar som importeras till Sendcloud."

#. translators: %1$s and %2$s wrap 'pending, processing' in bold; %3$s and %4$s wrap 'on-hold' in bold; the rest of the text explains default pre-selected statuses and their purpose
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:356
#, php-format
msgid ""
"When you first integrate WooCommerce with Sendcloud, three statuses are pre-"
"selected by default: %1$spending, processing%2$s, and %3$son-hold%4$s. This "
"ensures that completed or cancelled orders are not imported immediately. The "
"pre-selection helps you focus on orders that are ready to be processed."
msgstr ""
"När du först kopplar WooCommerce till Sendcloud är tre statusar förvalda: "
"%1$sväntar på betalning (pending), behandlas (processing)%2$s och %3$spausad "
"(on-hold)%4$s. Det gör att slutförda eller avbrutna ordrar inte importeras "
"direkt. Med förvalet kan du fokusera på ordrar som är redo att hanteras."

#. translators: %1$s and %2$s wrap 'Important:' in bold; %3$s and %4$s wrap 'pending, processing, on-hold, completed, etc.' in italics; %5$s and %6$s wrap 'Custom order statuses' as a clickable link; the rest of the text explains limitations of order status filtering
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:373
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%1$sImportant:%2$s Order status filtering currently only works with the "
"default WooCommerce statuses (e.g., %3$spending, processing, on-hold, "
"completed, etc.%4$s). %5$sCustom order statuses%6$s are not supported at "
"this time. If you’re using a plugin that adds custom statuses,\n"
"                                     those orders will not be imported into "
"Sendcloud."
msgstr ""
"%1$sViktigt:%2$s Filtrering på orderstatus fungerar just nu bara med "
"WooCommerce standardstatusar (t.ex. %3$sväntar på betalning, behandlas, pausad, "
"slutförd med flera%4$s). %5$sEgna orderstatusar%6$s stöds inte i nuläget. "
"Om du använder ett tillägg som lägger till egna statusar importeras de "
"ordrarna inte till Sendcloud."

#. translators: %1$s and %2$s wrap 'Settings' in italics; %3$s and %4$s wrap 'Integrations' as a clickable link; %5$s and %6$s wrap 'WooCommerce.' in bold
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:393
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:491
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/service-point/sendcloud-migrate.php:57
#, php-format
msgid ""
"In your Sendcloud account, go to %1$sSettings%2$s > %3$sIntegrations%4$s > "
"%5$sWooCommerce.%6$s"
msgstr ""
"Gå till %1$sInställningar%2$s > %3$sIntegrationer%4$s > %5$sWooCommerce%6$s "
"i ditt Sendcloud-konto."

#. translators: %1$s and %2$s wrap 'Select' in bold
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:413
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%1$sSelect%2$s the additional order statuses you want to include in your "
"filter."
msgstr "%1$sMarkera%2$s de orderstatusar du vill lägga till i filtret."

#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:423
msgid "Screenshot of Order Status Filter"
msgstr "Skärmbild av orderstatusfiltret"

#. translators: %1$s and %2$s wrap 'Save' button text in bold; the rest explains that Sendcloud will import orders with newly selected statuses
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:431
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Click %1$sSave%2$s. Once saved, Sendcloud will automatically import orders "
"with the newly selected statuses during future imports."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på %1$sSpara%2$s. När du har sparat importerar Sendcloud automatiskt "
"ordrar med de nyvalda statusarna vid kommande importer."

#. translators: %1$s and %2$s wrap 'Important:' in bold; %3$s and %4$s wrap 'last 30 days' in bold; %5$s and %6$s wrap 'customer support' as a clickable link; %7$s and %8$s wrap 'CSV file' as a clickable link; the rest of the text explains order import behavior
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:448
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%1$sImportant:%2$s When you modify your status filter, Sendcloud "
"automatically imports orders from the %3$slast 30 days%4$s that match the "
"new filter criteria. Orders older than 30 days will not be imported. If you "
"need to retrieve older orders, you can either contact\n"
"                                                     our %5$scustomer "
"support%6$s to manually trigger\n"
"                                                     the import, or upload "
"the orders using a %7$sCSV file%8$s."
msgstr ""
"%1$sViktigt:%2$s När du ändrar statusfiltret importerar Sendcloud "
"automatiskt ordrar från de %3$ssenaste 30 dagarna%4$s som matchar det nya "
"filtret. Ordrar som är äldre än 30 dagar importeras inte. Behöver du hämta "
"äldre ordrar kan du kontakta vår %5$skundsupport%6$s så startar de importen "
"manuellt, eller ladda upp ordrarna i en %7$sCSV-fil%8$s."

#. translators: Section heading for enabling or disabling parcel weight import
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:470
msgid "Enable/disable parcel weight import"
msgstr "Aktivera/inaktivera import av paketvikt"

#. translators: Short description explaining that this controls importing parcel weights from WooCommerce or assigning via Sendcloud
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:477
msgid ""
"To import exact parcel weights from WooCommerce or assign weights through "
"Sendcloud."
msgstr ""
"För att importera exakta paketvikter från WooCommerce eller anger vikter "
"i Sendcloud."

#. translators: %1$s and %2$s wrap 'Import the parcels’ weight' in bold; the text explains choosing whether to import parcel weights from WooCommerce
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:513
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Once on the Integration’s configuration page, check or uncheck %1$sImport "
"the parcels’ weight%2$s to choose whether to import weights from your "
"webshop."
msgstr ""
"På integrationens konfigurationssida markerar eller avmarkerar du %1$sImportera "
"paketens vikt%2$s för att välja om vikter ska importeras från din "
"webbutik."

#. translators: %1$s and %2$s wrap 'Note:' in bold; %3$s and %4$s wrap 'kg' in bold; %5$s and %6$s wrap 'g' in bold; the rest explains that only kg and g units are supported
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:528
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%1$sNote:%2$s Sendcloud currently only supports weights in %3$skg%4$s and "
"%5$sg%6$s. Therefore, if you want to import weights, please make sure they "
"are in one of these units. The weight is processed in kg once the order is "
"imported in Sendcloud."
msgstr ""
"%1$sOBS!%2$s Sendcloud stöder just nu bara vikter i %3$skg%4$s och "
"%5$sg%6$s. Om du vill importera vikter måste de därför vara i någon av de "
"enheterna. Vikten bearbetas i kg när ordern har importerats till Sendcloud."

#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:541
msgid "Screenshot of Import Status Weight"
msgstr "Skärmbild av import av vikt"

#. translators: %1$s and %2$s wrap 'Save' button text in bold
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:549
#, php-format
msgid "Click %1$sSave%2$s."
msgstr "Klicka på %1$sSpara%2$s."

#. translators: %1$s and %2$s wrap 'not' in italics; %3$s and %4$s wrap 'default weight' in italics; %5$s and %6$s wrap 'different weights' in italics; the rest explains assigning weights if not imported from the webshop
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:564
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If you chose %1$snot%2$s to import weights from your webshop (checkbox "
"unticked), you can assign weights in Sendcloud. You can either: set a "
"%3$sdefault weight%4$s for all items, or assign %5$sdifferent weights%6$s "
"using Shipping Rules."
msgstr ""
"Om du valde att %1$sinte%2$s importera vikter från din webbutik (kryssrutan "
"är avmarkerad) kan du ange vikter i Sendcloud. Du kan antingen ange en "
"%3$sstandardvikt%4$s för alla artiklar eller ange %5$solika vikter%6$s med "
"hjälp av Shipping Rules."

#. translators: %1$s and %2$s wrap 'this Help Center article' as a clickable link
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-manage-synchronisation.php:577
#, php-format
msgid "Learn how in %1$sthis Help Center article%2$s"
msgstr "Så här gör du: Läs %1$sden här artikeln i Help Center%2$s"

#. translators: Section heading for sending tracking notifications from Sendcloud
#: resources/views/wc-settings/dashboard/sendcloud-send-tracking.php:24
